(i) Names and addresses (local and permanent) of the injured persons or the owners of the damaged property, as the case may be;
(ii) Aadhar, PAN details and email-id, if any of the injured persons or the owners of the damaged property, as the case may be;
(iii) Names and addresses (local and permanent) of all the legal representatives of the deceased victim of the accident who are claiming compensation, their Aadhar and PAN details and email-id, if any;
(iv) Bank account details along with either a certificate of the banker giving all details of the bank account of the person or persons entitled to receive the compensation including IFS Code, or a copy of a cancelled cheque of the bank account.

